# Everything the function does not need. The API imports `packages/`, `services/api/`, `db/migrations-sqlite/` and
# `tools/` (for the migrator), and nothing else — so the web app, the docs and every local artifact stay out of the
# upload. A deployment that ships `web/node_modules` is a deployment whose upload time is measured in minutes.
web/
docs/
skills/
deploy/
var/
.tmp/
.tmp-*
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.log
.bak/
backup/
node_modules/
.next/
